<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Burr-Brown raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Burr-Brown raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said analyst Drew Peck upgraded Burr-Brown Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-3/16 to 22-7/8.</p>
</text>
